      "confidence": "medium",
      "file": "content/docs/iac/get-started/terraform/next-steps.md",
      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L152-160",
      "text": "`@pulumi/policy` exports `PolicyPack` and `validateResourceOfType`, and policies accept `name`, `description`, `enforcementLevel: \"mandatory\"`, and `validateResource` fields.",
      "type": "api-surface",
      "source_hint": "@pulumi/policy",
      "confidence": "high",
      "file": "content/docs/iac/get-started/terraform/next-steps.md",
      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L175-176",
      "text": "The `aws.s3.Bucket` resource has an `acl` property that can be checked for values `public-read` and `public-read-write`.",
